    <briefdescription>
<para>Registry of <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_cells_1_1_cell" kindref="compound">Marmot::Discretizations::Cells::Cell</ref> types, created by name. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Keeps two separate registries: Lagrangian cells, created from their node coordinates (<ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_registry_1_1_cell_factory_1a8aae2870a8313f0fe6f513ba70b1559d" kindref="member">registerCell()</ref> / <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_registry_1_1_cell_factory_1a9a5214743ead01fa21508d8d2f46af05" kindref="member">createCell()</ref>, e.g. <computeroutput>&quot;Displacement/Quad4&quot;</computeroutput>), and B-spline cells, which additionally need the knot vectors of the cell (<ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_registry_1_1_cell_factory_1a0b628d90299f9ebc529a80e52fb07671" kindref="member">registerBSplineCell()</ref> / <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_registry_1_1_cell_factory_1af86522ba5e428befdef4ecef7f69c08f" kindref="member">createBSplineCell()</ref>, e.g. <computeroutput>&quot;Displacement/BSpline/2&quot;</computeroutput>). Registration works as for <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_registry_1_1_material_point_factory" kindref="compound">MaterialPointFactory</ref>. Names are case-insensitive (stored in upper case). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
